Third-party notices for ResizeRight Optics CLI

The project code is licensed under the root MIT LICENSE. Rust dependencies
retain their separate terms; complete dependency license files accompany the
binary archive. PNG/JPEG use image/png, color conversion uses moxcms, and
HEIF/HEIC uses the user-selected oxideav-heif and oxideav-h265 Rust crates.
XMP orientation parsing uses roxmltree under its MIT OR Apache-2.0 license.
Resolved versions and any required registry dependencies are pinned in Cargo.lock.
No libheif, libde265, Kvazaar, or Apple image codec is used by this release.

